sprites / complex objects
- x draw complete object (either as multi cell geometry or a multi-cell sprite)
- x redraw the complete object for each cell it occupies, with a shader that masks
   x everything not in the given cell (ensure cells are sorted before drawing)
- for sprite specifically, you will need to know which cells to include/exclude.
        That include height. So you will need some kind of multi-level cell selection tool for the sprite.
        ex for the stairs, choose the diagonal floor tiles as well as the height tiles for proper ordering.
        Alternatively ignore height and do it just based on the based tile and height
    For geometry you'll need to know what cells to include
